## 2026-11-09T15:20:00Z Review of the 137 unmatched units (by hand, item numbers as above)

Before review the first pass (measure-4 state, before restorations) left 135 content units unmatched; five of them
carried facts present nowhere in the current report and were restored in the appendices (class D). After that, 137
